OL,3,GNEWSABenefits of high value residency
OL,4,Ascheme questioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is being urged to ask
OL,7,F"tough questions" about the value of a
OL,8,Fscheme that aims to attract wealthy
OL,9,Fpeople to Jersey.
OL,11,FThe high value residency programme
OL,12,Fgrants residential status to highly
OL,13,Fskilled and economically active high
OL,14,Fnet worth individuals, with those
OL,15,Fresidents paying a 20% tax rate on the
OL,16,Ffirst #1.25m of worldwide income and 1%
OL,17,Fon any income above #1.25m.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
