OL,3,GNEWSABenefits of high value residency
OL,4,Ascheme questioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Reform Jersey co-leader deputy
OL,7,FMonty Tadier questioned whether wealthy
OL,8,Findividuals could contribute more under
OL,9,Fthe scheme and called for data to be
OL,10,Freleased showing the benefits of the
OL,11,Fprogramme.
OL,13,FThe BBC has contacted the government
OL,14,Ffor comment.
